```
Search: most contacted URIs from a suspicious host (majority behaviour, not the first match)
Data: web/proxy or stream:http logs
MITRE ATT&CK: T1071.001 Application Layer Protocol: Web Protocols
Source: labs/tryhackme/2026-10-28-splunk-2-bots-v2.md
Lesson: in BOTS v2 the first decoded URL (news.php) was not the answer; counting showed process.php
Replace <suspicious_ip> with the host or C2 IP under investigation
```
index=* sourcetype="stream:http" (src_ip="<suspicious_ip>" OR dest_ip="<suspicious_ip>")
| stats count by uri_path dest_ip
| sort - count
